OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers expected, perhaps heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes through the evening and early
OL,8,Fhours. These likely dying away by dawn
OL,9,Fwith clear spells developing. Light
OL,10,Fwinds at first, strengthening through
OL,11,Fthe evening to become breezy overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FDry and bright at first with
OL,14,Fsome sunny spells. Cloud soon
OL,15,Fthickening from the west, bringing
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain in the afternoon,
OL,17,Fwith heavy bursts possible in the
OL,18,Fearly hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
