OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing to sunny spells and blustery
OL,7,Fshowers on Friday. Largely dry on
OL,8,FSaturday, with lighter winds and sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Mostly dry Sunday, with
OL,10,Fisolated showers possible.
OL,11,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
